      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a quick email to one of our suppliers? We just got their invoice for the resin shipment this month but the quantity billed doesn't match what we actually received in the warehouse. I need to ask them for an explanation and a credit memo to fix the difference. Needs to be professional so they take it seriously. Thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
